# =============================================================================
# User-added packages for the userdata partition
# =============================================================================
# Edit this file to add extra apps without rebuilding system.img.
#
# Format (one per line):
#   click:<openstore-id>     e.g. click:com.ubuntu.terminal
#   deb:<package-name>       e.g. deb:htop  (staged only; install via provision)
#
# Provision after flash (does NOT wipe userdata):
#   bash scripts/provision_userdata_packages.sh
#
# Also staged into userdata.img by scripts/build_userdata_img.sh under:
#   /data/ubuntu-gsi/user-packages/{clicks,debs}/
# =============================================================================

# Examples (commented):
# click:com.ubuntu.terminal
# click:gallery.ubports
